{"pin":"AB01097","subcodes":[{"code":"AB01097","anchor":"","first_line":"O thou who hast journeyed in the path of God! The letter which thou didst address to his honour Haji was perused [3.5s]... ...O Lord! Guard Thou the children that are born in Thy day, are nurtured at the breast of Thy love","first_line_orig":"یا من سافر فی سبیل الله مراسله که بجناب حاجی مرقوم فرموده بودید ملاحظه گردید  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"300","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"AKHA_128BE #04-05 p.152","source":"AKHA_128BE #04-05 p.152","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/akhbar-i-amri/"},{"kind":"publication","code":"HUV2.018x","source":"HUV2","locator":"018x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/H2/h2-22.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MJTB.114","source":"MJTB","locator":"114","url":"https://adibmasumian.files.wordpress.com/2023/05/mjtb.pdf"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_APAB#10x","source":"BRL_APAB","locator":"10x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/556983696"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_CHILD#17x","source":"BRL_CHILD","locator":"17x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/473022011"}]},{"code":"AB01097GUA","anchor":"gua","translations":[{"language":"ro","lang_name":"Romanian"},{"language":"nl","lang_name":"Dutch"},{"language":"es","lang_name":"Spanish"},{"language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"language":"gil","lang_name":"Gilbertese"},{"language":"ne","lang_name":"Nepali"}]}]}
